{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 35","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be an interior point of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54fede6a3eae4a624bef79f80af184b29b499eee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1=OA+OB+OC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"170\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/d/21d31ac94410a7993af5485c37960533c1fa34fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2=AB+BC+CA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"170\" height=\"15\" />, then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/818f8e513e89950485d6f3f60ec4d3f9bc3fe44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) for every triangle } s_2&gt;2s_1,s_1 \\le s_2 \\\\  \\text{(B) for every triangle } s_2&gt;2s_1,s_1 &lt; s_2 \\\\  \\text{(C) for every triangle } s_1&gt; \\tfrac{1}{2}s_2,s_1 &lt; s_2 \\\\  \\text{(D) for every triangle } s_2\\ge 2s_1,s_1 \\le s_2 \\\\  \\text{(E) neither (A) nor (B) nor (C) nor (D) applies to every triangle}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"472\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the Triangle Inequality, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/1/4c13ef12103444de6adc8fbdec8a55b25a879795.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1 &gt; \\frac12 s_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"68\" height=\"37\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />. -Dark_Lord\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">Problem 34</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1966 AHSME Pro